mengajak masyarakat agar berperan aktif dalam pemulihan dan reintegrasi;
melakukan penguatan fungsi organisasi kemasyarakatan yang bergerak dalam bidang pemberdayaan Perempuan; melakukan berbagai sosialisasi mengenai pencegahan dan antisipasi terjadinya tindak kekerasan terhadap Perempuan kepada berbagai komponen masyarakat di Daerah; dan optimalisasi peran lembaga keagamaan, lembaga adat, budaya, serta penggalian kearifan lokal dalam rangka mencegah dan meminimalisasi terjadi kekerasan terhadap Perempuan baik yang terjadi di rumah atau di luar rumah.

translated_text:
Part Two
Prevention of Acts of Violence Against Women Article 46 To anticipate and prevent acts of violence against Women from occurring, the Regional Government shall undertake the following efforts:
a.
b.
f.
provide various proper public facilities for Women in public spaces;
develop an integrated information system database on acts of violence against Women;
strengthen the competence of apparatus handling violence against Women;
create various modules and guidelines on the prevention and handling of acts of violence against Women;
conduct various training and guidance for social workers operating in organizations/institutions handling violence against Women;
invite the community to play an active role in recovery and reintegration;
strengthen the function of community organizations operating in the field of Women's empowerment; conduct various socialization regarding prevention and anticipation of acts of violence against Women to various components of society in the Region; and optimize the role of religious institutions, customary institutions, culture, as well as exploration of local wisdom in order to prevent and minimize violence against Women occurring both at home or outside the home.

text:
Pasal 48
Pemberdayaan Perempuan korban kekerasan sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 47 dapat berupa:
a. pelatihan keterampilan kerja;
b. pengembangan usaha ekonomi produktif baik perorangan maupun kelompok;
c. bantuan permodalan dengan mengupayakan kredit lunak; d. mempermudah akses ke dunia perbankan dan non- perbankan; dan
e. bantuan pemasaran berbagai produk yang dihasilkan Perempuan korban kekerasan.

translated_text:
Article 48
Empowerment of Women victims of violence as referred to in Article 47 may take the form of:
a. job skills training;
